## 1. Introduction

BeatFrame is a Blogger template designed for rappers, singers, music producers, DJs, independent artists, and other creative professionals.

This license explains the permissions and conditions under which the BeatFrame theme and its associated files may be used, modified, copied, and distributed.

By downloading, installing, copying, modifying, or redistributing BeatFrame, you agree to the terms described in this license.

